    "id": "p64-q22-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "",
    "prompt": "$OAB$ is a triangle. $M$ is the midpoint of $OA$. $N$ is the midpoint of $OB$.\n\n$\\overrightarrow{OM}=\\underset{\\sim}{a},\\quad\\overrightarrow{ON}=\\underset{\\sim}{b}$.\n\nShow that $AB$ is parallel to $MN$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [
      {
        "id": "p64-q22-diagram",
        "role": "question",
        "format": "tikz",
        "code": "% mathsmap-diagram-colours {\"version\":1,\"kind\":\"geometry\",\"base\":[],\"semantic\":[],\"reference\":\"page 64 p64-q22-diagram\"}\n\\begin{tikzpicture}[x=1cm,y=1cm,line width=0.8pt,every node/.style={font=\\fontsize{10}{12}\\selectfont},>=stealth]\n\\special{dvisvgm:raw <metadata data-graph-strokes=\"1\"/>}\n\\coordinate (O) at (0,0);\\coordinate (A) at (3.5,3);\\coordinate (B) at (5.2,0);\n\\coordinate (M) at ($(O)!0.5!(A)$);\\coordinate (N) at ($(O)!0.5!(B)$);\n\\draw (O)--(A)--(B)--cycle;\n\\draw[->] (O)--($(O)!0.4!(A)$);\\draw[->] (O)--($(O)!0.25!(B)$);\n\\fill (M) circle (1.6pt);\\fill (N) circle (1.6pt);\n\\path (O)--(M) node[midway,above left] {$\\underset{\\sim}{a}$};\\path (O)--(N) node[midway,below] {$\\underset{\\sim}{b}$};\n\\node[below left] at (O) {$O$};\\node[above] at (A) {$A$};\\node[below right] at (B) {$B$};\\node[above left] at (M) {$M$};\\node[below] at (N) {$N$};\n\\end{tikzpicture}",
        "src": null,
